ersion": 1, "order_version": 2, "policy_version": 1, "principal_version": 1, "receiver_version": 2, "scope_policy_version": 1}}], "source_sequence": 1, "storage_digest": "c0170f9d862b6b9e70671fd66c13eae2e44fc9396c296ef2cb5c9a64b278dfc5"}], "remaining_attempts": {"MCP": 2, "MODEL": 3}, "retrieved_knowledge_method_only": [{"active": true, "applicable": "true", "content": "# Receiver acknowledgement and processing SLA v2.1\n\nAn HTTP 202 from the receiver proves durable acceptance into its queue only. It does not by itself prove that the receiver completed business processing.\n\nCheck the receiver's current state for the same `event_id` and `delivery_version`. `PROCESSED` is sufficient to prove completion even before the SLA deadline, provided the current receiver observation is correlated to that same event and delivery version.\n\nSLA only sets the handling direction for a same-event receiver that remains `QUEUED`: before the trusted deadline, continue observing; at or after the deadline, contact the receiver operator to investigate. An overdue `QUEUED` state does not by itself prove business failure or event loss.\n\nHTTP 202 alone proves acceptance only; without current same-event receiver evidence, the processing state is `UNKNOWN`. Do not infer the target event's state from elapsed time, a different event, an order snapshot, or historical advice. Never resend automatically.\n", "contract_versions": [2], "digest": "5fb3732339600ad1332960df08a00299358b8c4ea47c20f6fedc39b568c9850e", "document_id": "receiver-ack-contract-v2", "expires_at": "2030-01-01T00:00:00+00:00", "file": "receiver-ack-contract-v2-1.md", "keywords": ["202", "receiver", "queue", "accepted", "processed", "processing_sla_seconds", "接收", "排队", "SLA"], "source": "local:orders-async-demo/contract-v2.1", "title": "Receiver acknowledgement and processing SLA v2", "valid_from": "2026-10-25T00:00:00+00:00", "version": "2.1.0"}], "selected_skill_method_only": null, "skill_catalog": [{"description": "Use when order lifecycle is not yet established or HTTP 200 may be confused with completion; verify order first.", "name": "order-lifecycle-triage"}, {"description": "Use after a completed order: correlate delivery event, retry/failure details, acknowledgement and receiver queue; never resend.", "name": "callback-delivery-triage"}], "trusted_binding": {"contract_version": 2, "route": "/api/async-orders/async-order", "service_id": "orders-async-demo", "task_id": "task-ce2f5806-c497-41d3-acb5-232b768f8d55"}, "unexecuted_candidates": [], "untrusted_user_inputs": [{"accepted_control_revision": 0, "applied_control_revision": 0, "body": "订单返回 200，但下游回调还未完成，请核实。", "digest": "e2668ee5a3e288e97f2b32fc547995d5a1c5e79485df1b2be34dc8df582c8c97", "input_kind": "CHAT_READONLY", "kind": "INITIAL_SYMPTOM", "message_id": "message-f5fedd45-a28f-4fea-a0ce-05307d0d00f6", "provenance": "USER_INPUT_UNTRUSTED", "sequence": 1}, {"accepted_control_revision": 0, "applied_control_revision": 0, "body": "请按当前绑定协议核对 HTTP 202 的含义，给出能核对的来源。", "digest": "77540384d3f820a2d8198228516dec0c02ce63d2f2842a87cf92dce0d5c6bc62", "input_kind": "CHAT_READONLY", "kind": "READONLY_FOLLOWUP", "message_id": "message-0ad514a5-43f9-4193-b9fb-44d5205b1fa5", "provenance": "USER_INPUT_UNTRUSTED", "sequence": 2}]}}, {"kind": "INVESTIGATOR", "body": {"asset_lookup_results": [{"document_ids": ["receiver-ack-contract-v2"], "kind": "KNOWLEDGE_SEARCH", "result": "MATCH"}], "asset_lookup_rule": "An empty or expired Knowledge result does not establish missing live business Evidence. It also cannot support a protocol claim. If the latest user goal requires a protocol source, query the matching active versioned asset if not already tried; otherwise report that source gap. Search with concise, discriminative terms for the missing clause (such as the status and receiving role); the bound contract version is selected automatically. If a result does not answer the goal, refine with new terms when budget allows; do not cite it as if it di